Welcome to Baby Panda's Chinese Recipes! This is a cooking game about Chinese cuisine where you can cook various Chinese dishes according to the recipes, and become a good Chinese food chef as you explore and learn! Are you ready? Let's start cooking!

VARIOUS RECIPES
You will find 13 kinds of Chinese food in this cooking game. Apart from staples like noodles and steamed buns, there are also specialties such as Peking duck and steamed fish. Now, festive food like sweet rice dumplings and Zongzi are also available for you to explore and cook!

EASY TO COOK
In this cooking game, you are provided with a detailed recipe for each dish. Following Baby Panda's cooking tips, you can chop, fry, deep-fry and cook delicious Chinese dishes with just a few moves of your finger! Come and try it out!

LOVELY CUSTOMERS
Customers will give you surprising responses! It could be their happy face when they eat something delicious, or their fire-breathing mouth when they eat something spicy! Watch their reactions, find out what they like, and cook more dishes that they like!

In this cooking game, you can not only learn about Chinese recipes, but also gain knowledge about traditional Chinese food! Join us and discover Chinese recipes now!

FEATURES:
- Various recipes: 13 special Chinese dishes, such as dumplings and noodles;
- Diverse ingredients: 40+ ingredients, such as apples, mushrooms and lobsters;
- 6 ways of cooking: frying, boiling, stir-frying, instant boiling and more;
- Kid-friendly designs: simple operation and step-by step instructions;
- Customized food: make different flavors based on customers' preferences;
- Support offline play: play offline anytime and anywhere!

Help your baby discover the wonders of shapes and colors with the “Toddler Learning Games” app by Bimi Boo. Designed specifically for children up to 5 years old, this 100% safe educational app turns learning into an exciting journey filled with fun and joy.
This toddler game introduces children to the world of shapes and colors while also promoting their cognitive development, sparking curiosity, and encouraging exploration in a fun and engaging way.
With 30 learning puzzles, “Toddler Learning Games” engages kids with lively animations and simple, easy-to-follow activities designed for both learning and entertainment.
The educational app includes kids’ games such as:
- Sorting by color, shape, quantity, and size;
- Identification of objects by their properties;
- Comparison of geometric shapes with their outlines;
- Arrangement of objects in suitable places;
- Feeding animals the appropriate food;
- Collecting images from memory.
“Toddler Learning Games” by Bimi Boo is more than a simple game. It’s an extensive educational resource that teaches differentiation of shapes, colors, quantities, and textures, while also improving manual dexterity, concentration, and cognitive skills. It encompasses all essentials for your child’s enjoyable and comprehensive development.
These toddler puzzles were created with children’s safety in mind and do not collect or share data with third parties. The kid-friendly interface of the app helps children easily navigate the application, which is one of the game’s main features.
Help your toddler immerse themselves in educational puzzles and activities that introduce and teach shapes and colors in a simple, easy way. Start your baby’s development adventure now!

In Little Panda's Town, you will meet many new friends, start different adventures, and create endless stories! Come and join us at the "Fairytale Festival", and explore the open world just for you!

EXPLORE FREELY
You can go anywhere in the town world for fun explorations. Go shopping at the mall, design rooms, cook food, learn magic, create art, relive fairy tales and do whatever you want! You will also discover all the hidden games in the police station, magic train, mushroom house, animal shelter, vacation hotel, magic academy, and other places!

MAKE FRIENDS
An increasing number of characters from real life and fairy tales will come to the town. The doctor, house designer, policeman, supermarket staff, white horse, prince, mage, and other characters are looking forward to becoming your friends. You can also create your own character by customizing their skin color, hairstyle, expression and more, dress them up with different clothes and accessories, and interact with them!

TELL STORIES
Are you ready to tell your own town story? In this open world, there are no rules or goals. You can create endless stories and discover lots of surprises. Go shopping, decorate your dream restaurant, and celebrate every holiday with your town friends! This is where your fairy tale dreams come true!

Can't wait to explore Little Panda's Town? Then download Little Panda's Town: My World now and create happy memories of town life with your town friends!

FEATURES:
- Explore an open world that simulates the reality and fairy tales of a small town;
- Create your own stories without any game objectives or rules;
- Customize your character: skin color, hairstyle, clothes, expression, etc.
- Decorate your house with hundreds of items like furniture, wallpaper, and more;
- 50+ buildings and 60+ themed areas to discover;
- Countless characters to become friends with;
- Nearly 6,000 interactive items to use;
- All characters and items can be used freely across scenes;
- Supports offline play;
- Special festival items are added accordingly.

